### =============================================================
### TORTIKI — Reviews (Sprint 3 — Issues 45 & 46)
### POST /api/v1/reviews  → 201 (ROLE_BUYER + demande CONFIRMED)
### Règles :
###   doublon acheteur/annonce         → 409
###   acheteur sans demande CONFIRMED  → 403 (ReviewNotAllowedException)
###   ROLE_SELLER                      → 403
###   rating hors [1-5]                → 400
###   sans authentification            → 401
### ⚠️  Pré-requis :
###   - contactRequestId CONFIRMED (04-seller-dashboard.http étapes [6][7])
### =============================================================

### [1] Login Théo — BUYER
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{theoEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###

### [2] Théo note l'annonce de Sofia → 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listingId": {{listingId}},
  "rating": 4,
  "comment": "Excellent bortsch, très savoureux ! Je recommande vivement Sofia."
}

> {%
    client.test("Notation → 201 Created, rating 4", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 201, "Expected 201, got " + response.status);
        client.assert(response.body.rating === 4, "Note attendue : 4");
        client.global.set("reviewId", response.body.id);
    });
%}

###

### [3] Doublon notation → 409 Conflict (ReviewAlreadyExistsException)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listingId": {{listingId}},
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "2e tentative — doit être bloquée"
}

> {%
    client.test("Doublon notation → 409 Conflict", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 409, "Expected 409, got " + response.status);
    });
%}

###

### [4] Rating invalide — note 6 → 400 Bad Request (@Max(5))
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listingId": {{listingId}},
  "rating": 6,
  "comment": "Note hors plage"
}

> {%
    client.test("Rating 6 → 400 Bad Request", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 400, "Expected 400, got " + response.status);
    });
%}

###

### [5] Rating invalide — note 0 → 400 Bad Request (@Min(1))
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listingId": {{listingId}},
  "rating": 0,
  "comment": "Note à zéro"
}

> {%
    client.test("Rating 0 → 400 Bad Request", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 400, "Expected 400, got " + response.status);
    });
%}

###

### [6] Login Sofia — SELLER
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{sofiaEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###

### [7] SELLER tente de noter → 403 Forbidden (RBAC)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listingId": {{listingId}},
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Test vendeur — doit être bloqué"
}

> {%
    client.test("SELLER note → 403 Forbidden", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 403, "Expected 403, got " + response.status);
    });
%}

###

### [8] Sans authentification → 401 Unauthorized
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listingId": {{listingId}},
  "rating": 3,
  "comment": "Sans cookie"
}

> {%
    client.test("Notation sans auth → 401 Unauthorized", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 401, "Expected 401, got " + response.status);
    });
%}

###

### [9] Login Théo — notation sur annonce dont demande est REFUSED → 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{theoEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###

### Théo tente de noter listing2Id (demande REFUSED → aucune CONFIRMED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listingId": {{listing2Id}},
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Demande refusée — notation interdite"
}

> {%
    client.test("Sans demande CONFIRMED → 403 (ReviewNotAllowedException)", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 403, "Expected 403, got " + response.status);
    });
%}